NOTE ON EXTERNAL TOOLS

This repository orchestrates third-party tools that are NOT bundled and carry
their own licenses. You must obtain and comply with each separately:

  - Boltz / Boltz-2        (https://github.com/jwohlwend/boltz)
  - LigandMPNN             (https://github.com/dauparas/LigandMPNN)
  - DiffDock               (https://github.com/gcorso/DiffDock)
  - GNINA                  (https://github.com/gnina/gnina)
  - AutoDock Vina          (https://vina.scripps.edu/)
  - OpenMM                 (https://openmm.org/)
  - FoldX                  (https://foldxsuite.crg.eu/  - academic license)
  - Rosetta                (https://rosettacommons.org/  - license required)
  - MAFFT / HMMER / MMseqs2 / Foldseek (see their respective sites)

See docs/DATA_AND_WEIGHTS.md for acquisition instructions.
